{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "68959d374d9dbdb0bc7eede369160b7ec1eb92928b6f7e4fccffb5a583f40fad", "ja": "等身大のわたしたち", "zh": "毫无掩饰的我们", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ec69514f2d829349f93c988bf760b2f407b8745b7780de7d5573fb404b2cfa7", "ja": "グラビア撮影当日、3人のテーマが決まる。\n緊張する可憐に、香りつきのリップクリーム\nを塗る茜と翼。オレンジの香りで落ち着きを\n取り戻す可憐。撮影後、『りるきゃん』の\n編集長から、新たな仕事を依頼される。", "zh": "写真照拍摄当天，三位偶像终于决定了主题。\n茜与翼为紧张的可怜涂上香味护唇膏，\n柳橙香味帮助可怜静下心来。\n拍摄完成后，《莉露甜心》的总编\n委托了一件新工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a523b18b9551e37efe43ee6c98b97a63932c0fbe2566bf17dffbb86c311e7416", "ja": "（『りるきゃん』のグラビア撮影当日。\n3人とも、揃っているが……）", "zh": "（《莉露甜心》的写真照拍摄当天，\n三位偶像都到齐了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "13b3b5e75ea8220feae1f7f963f621a8252879602cbf0d379c42cb44ae0744e2", "ja": "なんだか今回は、準備らしい準備を\nしてこなかった気がする……。", "zh": "我总觉得这次工作\n似乎都没做什么像样的准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "184237874567b395f0cf65564d4f207e3389cd3731ad534d923936afd00b1f50", "ja": "何を言うかね、{$P$}ちゃん。\n茜ちゃんたちはこの仕事を通じて、大いに成長したよ！", "zh": "小{$P$}，你怎么这么说呢？\n小茜我们可是透过这次工作有了很大的成长啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6c1969f460568a5a6883cd4c7a64254549a19cd98a655f89afbb934731aa1a6", "ja": "そうそう！　最近の流行もリサーチしたし、\nメイクの修行とか、恋愛の修行も……。", "zh": "对啊对啊！我们研究了时下流行趋势、\n做了化妆的修行、还有恋爱的修行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1437f53f16c0ed84b11a87b4c81a616d7bf89fbe31147d927e6bad48c7732def", "ja": "恋愛の修行？", "zh": "恋爱的修行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "b167c7f23ea099f18592ffd293b8862314af1506c68ef1d3b68c9a8d3a5dd86c", "ja": "つ、翼ちゃん……！　それは、\n{$P$}さんにはナイショで……！", "zh": "小、小翼……！\n这件事要对{$P$}先生保密……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8e729756bd236fdf6693d0a39e4abd812a05f1503e1b6a8245425e1c4e89961", "ja": "あ、そうだった。\nえへへ、なんでもありませーん！", "zh": "啊，我忘了。\n嘿嘿，我什么都没说啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "521711da92463a97256589cc9592251b46c3ad016d901dbc72db773be5d61164", "ja": "いや、でも今、恋愛の修行って……。", "zh": "不是，你刚刚明明说恋爱的修行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "bd45bfc40175e18b1c6cfcb8de305ab709c30a0e53ef66707afdabe514dacd67", "ja": "わたし達、『りるきゃん』の漫画をたくさん読んで、\n恋する女の子の気持ちを勉強したんですよー。", "zh": "我们看了很多《莉露甜心》上的漫画，\n体会了女孩子恋爱中的心情喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "4fe49fd4382ebb1696206ae3ef67df2b7de09df0b3d5a7682240c80cd5a7dbf9", "ja": "まつりさんが、たくさん持ってきてくれて……\nす、すごく、参考になりました……。", "zh": "茉莉带了很多漫画给我们看……\n非、非常具有参考价值……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "e84cf6ffa30422d89df97b6d5e7e2469128983a9608fba9a1a14d3ccd648d30c", "ja": "そうそう！　だから{$P$}ちゃんは、\nなーんにも気にしなくていいからね？", "zh": "没错没错！所以小{$P$}，\n你不用想太多喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b3fa1fb366a9a3e031d5d3f0c6e581da116589e1c83c89bec34997672590acde", "ja": "そうか、まつりが……\nで、その少女漫画は参考になったか？", "zh": "这样啊，是茉莉借你们漫画……\n那么，那些少女漫画有给你们什么帮助吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "af9098623bd8c54f3e9bcc1bb1ec2fbf87288947c500cc88be903a0ba40801e6", "ja": "は、はい！　初恋の人を追いかけていた女の子が、\nいろいろあって、修行の旅に出るんですけど……。", "zh": "像、像是！有个女孩一直追求初恋的对象，\n然后中间发生了很多事，于是她踏上修行之旅……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e640741a9b27342d7b582c9e89df3d385c50777524e4346a71e53c6ca9420152", "ja": "……ずいぶん、いろいろあったんだな。", "zh": "……中间也发生太多事了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "0e6951160e201d886935cd9c25fb0304d4d006fb2bad67ca6cabef7d8c83eb64", "ja": "とっても面白かったですし……\nすごく、べ、勉強になりました……！", "zh": "那部漫画很好看……\n我从中、学、学习了很多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "96cc8a495ac7f3fa6bde49f6b7aa9ec9450ed215c53d03918a2d1afdd69e0317", "ja": "あ……憧れている人に、恋をする気持ち……\n私にも、すこし、わ、わかるようで……。", "zh": "喜……喜欢上憧憬的对象是什么感觉……\n现在我似乎也有一点、明、明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1016_023aka", "source_sha256": "c14b9f9d59404bb95f9679f3ace706f6dd5026c3d3b8d1864c1d3eaa699547cd", "ja": "そうだね、茜ちゃんも参考になったよ！\nドキドキでキュンキュンな、恋する乙女ゴコロ……！", "zh": "对啊，小茜也有很多收获！\n知道了心跳加速、小鹿乱撞的恋爱少女心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "51801b31be3b7eac6420aadab0a5c516574247bf57cc88eb2c372d393831ddd3", "ja": "乙女ゴコロへの理解なくして、\n恋愛番長への道ならず！　だよね、翼ちゃん！", "zh": "不先理解少女心，\n怎么当得了恋爱高手！？对吧？小翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "00a584106b3b8dc1bb95dfc685c02ee5a2eec89457f3128ce65984bf31c6925f", "ja": "はい！　なので今日のわたしたち、すっごくカワイイ\nグラビアになっちゃうと思いまーす！", "zh": "对！所以我们觉得今天\n应该会拍出超可爱的写真照喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "67a552b2c00a00f1d4a2b18ca1625919b93f2e9fef48a345f472f05edce2601e", "ja": "おお、それはよかった……けど、思い出したぞ！\n皆、ユニットのテーマはどうなったんだ？", "zh": "喔喔，那就太棒了……等等，我想起来了！\n最后你们的团体主题决定得怎样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "8266e4164bfe3793f7fed72db282088456f9b1e785480d611446572e6c64c3f3", "ja": "あっ……そ、そのことなんですが……。\n私たち3人で、話し合ってきました……。", "zh": "啊……关、关于这个……\n我们三个人讨论过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "f235af61a69e125ede6a250f38fcc078f0a190e252cc67df519a013e54332eb4", "ja": "いや～、フレッシュな茜ちゃんたちにピッタリな\nテーマが決まったよね！　それでは……翼ちゃんから！", "zh": "哎呀～小茜我们这么年轻有活力，\n决定的主题也很适合我们喔！那么……请小翼发表吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e68be53478d7eae520629ba1a554fdf7affb878bdb7eef7d343584fb4eb6c8f3", "ja": "はい！\nテーマは、『等身大のわたしたち』でーす！", "zh": "好的！\n主题就是『毫无掩饰的我们』喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "3b1b9b623a6b032dfd37aa571830cdcd9a2edc4cd26836212618ef64220f9281", "ja": "わ、私たちも、色んなものに憧れていて……だから、\n等身大が『りるきゃん』には合ってるよね、って……♪", "zh": "我、我们内心怀抱着各种憧憬……所以，\n毫无掩饰的我们正符合了《莉露甜心》的风格对吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bdc2f8f0107636e163416ace51ad2558b8601aa66bf0e83e7054fa52d718d343", "ja": "『等身大のわたしたち』……。\nなるほど、いいテーマじゃないか。", "zh": "『毫无掩饰的我们』……\n原来如此，这主题很不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "c39edfa4747105e9c023d8e3ed681ed2de68fd3226f6ff0c745e12d202be6290", "ja": "わかった！　グラビアも期待できそうだ。\nそれじゃあ翼、茜、可憐、行ってこい！", "zh": "就这么决定吧！看来写真照也很值得期待了。\n那么，翼、茜、可怜，去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "715aad2ef968af57b84e51abc0845773b0c842281e29f8a51053b68d9e3ae177", "ja": "はい……！", "zh": "好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1028_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "好──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0a9c1f3dc10e1458e0090404e140480d27501c45d27d16ac34f49968c414b86b", "ja": "わたしの撮影は、これで終わり！\n次は可憐さんだね。いってらっしゃーい！", "zh": "我的拍摄已经结束了！\n下一个换可怜了吧？慢走喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1031_045kar", "source_sha256": "fe503f2068ede102b8c276ad69a37f590c475d14be5c58dcdf34b002d31c6e69", "ja": "は、はい……！　でも……うう、どうしよう。\n劇場と違う雰囲気なせいか、緊張してしまって……。", "zh": "好、好的……！不过……呜呜，怎么办？\n可能是这里的气氛和剧场不同，我紧张起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "062199ae29070b7932c6bbf528bdb0e137277dcf3bb197f036fb5422e8e9e95a", "ja": "そんなに緊張しなくても大丈夫だよ、可憐さん。\nカメラマンさん優しいし……あっ、そうだ！", "zh": "不用这么紧张，没事的，可怜。\n摄影师人很好的……啊！对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f094446d51f152460cd39cd5300331fca1f749b6061bc9a4636d3fcd08f13606", "ja": "緊張してる可憐さんに……はいっ！　これ♪", "zh": "既然可怜这么紧张……来！这个给你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1034_045kar", "source_sha256": "5560cdc0baee0bb32fffd4b9757110f9ec9a7211bd41fea006f0d21ad4232c81", "ja": "え……？　あ、あれ？\nなんだか、いい香りがする……。", "zh": "咦……？奇、奇怪？\n好像有股香味……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1035_016tsu", "source_sha256": "66d28db5616dd786863f5f28850d300ed39c3a9adee533e97ecec15636a17947", "ja": "えへへ♪　香りつきのリップクリームでーす！\nいいにおいでしょ？", "zh": "嘿嘿♪这是香味护唇膏──！\n很香吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1036_045kar", "source_sha256": "51e79c0073436231a6e54758c1c82f58739e58439bbcaf60a8070af3e016b555", "ja": "う、うん……えっと、オレンジの香りかな……？\nすごく、ホッとする……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯……这个是，柳橙的香味吗……？\n非常让人放松……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1037_023aka", "source_sha256": "beac5b898bcb5d85ad435b0a5d6f41a0863ed9513bc0304a9a028a636c646f6b", "ja": "おお～！？\nさすが可憐ちゃん、大正解だよ！", "zh": "喔喔～！？\n不愧是小可怜，正确答案！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1038_023aka", "source_sha256": "76af6ab8456affb440d626975c93219c38d8a520398e586664cd6b063a9054d2", "ja": "美希ちゃんと風花ちゃんにメイクしてもらったでしょ？\nあの時のリップだよ！", "zh": "小美希和小风花不是有教小茜我们化妆吗？\n这就是当时的护唇膏喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1039_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b8e11ba9a8f9b4c6c02e110086c0e88211e86511a596df2842552230b9bbb05", "ja": "美希ちゃんに教えてもらって、買ってきたんです♪\nこれは、可憐さんにあげまーす！", "zh": "美希有告诉我这是哪一款，我后来跑去买了♪\n这支就送给可怜吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1040_045kar", "source_sha256": "764b7ba496a3d0e1454604cb67014d82bbe8cafb63b3284e88dbaffe45dd9f78", "ja": "え！？　で、でも、いいの……？\nせっかく、翼ちゃんが買ったのに……。", "zh": "咦！？可、可是，这样好吗……？\n这是小翼专程去买的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "c5cf79e50616309714cb16e671c3cbffa02e154f99f5e3cafc4586300e4b2a63", "ja": "大丈夫、茜ちゃんと翼ちゃんの分もあるから！\n3人で、いい匂いさせちゃおう☆", "zh": "放心吧，小茜和小翼也都有一支！\n三个人一起散发香味吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1042_045kar", "source_sha256": "2bff45287cfc28f7f625382f1c040dc178115986b64bad02ba709d17f1d31817", "ja": "ふ、ふたりとも……あ、ありがとう……。", "zh": "谢、谢谢……你、你们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "04efcfdbbd008a6bbf30f507f550aef211e02b9b3b49ffeb36b7fa9da6a2a5fb", "ja": "よかったな、可憐！", "zh": "太好了，可怜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1044_045kar", "source_sha256": "0aca4e18d064bc6f4f2ad3a7ea830b850c899573048d3cbe79334efdf2bca7a3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nわ、私……この香りで、がんばれそうです……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n我、我……有这股香味相伴，应该就能努力拍摄了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "0addabd4d1bd2389d69d4ad9152e9b668baef7cf98f6b1ad4aa5a33855373fa9", "ja": "ああ。翼と茜も、遊んでばっかりじゃなくて、\nちゃんとユニットの事を考えてたんだな。えらいぞ！", "zh": "嗯，看来翼和茜并没有只顾着玩乐，\n还是有好好为团体着想的，很棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1046_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d201453d40d32296981de4f0a2a96a292f92866d17d27bd1fb54f35541cb17cc", "ja": "えへへ……\n{$P$}さんにほめられちゃった♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……\n{$P$}先生夸奖我耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed064611b16c5deaa93b955947b8710763f4ff1d68e4aa2926be33f4d5685ab3", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん、\n茜ちゃんにはナデナデとプリン！　よろしくね！", "zh": "小{$P$}，\n要记得给小茜摸摸头和布丁喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "1328c8ff6714ae2136ca16ec86c5b529768fc0acbedc31399ed041bbc02f2855", "ja": "（可憐はリップクリームを大事そうに握りしめて、\nカメラの前に向かう……もう、大丈夫そうだな！）", "zh": "（可怜小心翼翼地握住护唇膏，\n走到镜头前……看来她已经没问题了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1051_p", "source_sha256": "26c5e8f81632af36c9ab4c43a77c50555aae2639297c3e885473085cd6a13c3a", "ja": "さてと。撮影は無事に終わったし、\nあとは翼たちの支度ができてから……", "zh": "好啦，拍摄顺利结束，\n接下来就等翼她们换完衣服……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1053_henshucho", "source_sha256": "3a65d14456a6002dd7d4bd0b2e64a200a275100e8078e20cf97daa8d84bb6ba9", "ja": "あの、すみません。765プロの\nプロデューサーさん、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "那个，不好意思。\n765艺能的制作人先生，方便打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1054_p", "source_sha256": "a180795559f6c8e263c9fe06aeb7798419cd7bd4e446cfaa8beb14378e29ebfe", "ja": "あなたは……『りるきゃん』の編集長さん？\n俺に何か？", "zh": "你是……《莉露甜心》的总编吗？\n请问找我有什么事情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1055_henshucho", "source_sha256": "3e028dde4f16496e227bf71d42975d2854c516d7626335e6961b6a26c21e6975", "ja": "ええ。実は、ご相談があって……。今回、うちの\nイメージモデルになってくれた、3人の事なんですが。", "zh": "嗯，是这样的，我有件事想跟你商量……\n是关于这次担任我们杂志形象模特儿的三位偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1056_henshucho", "source_sha256": "9568fb2e13c19fbc82052d82cd2192a182ec7dd763808830ba54c9dc304adf4f", "ja": "『りるきゃん』読者と近い感性を持っている彼女達に、\nふろくをプロデュースしてもらえないかと思いまして。", "zh": "她们的想法与《莉露甜心》的读者群相近，\n所以我想请她们企划杂志的附录商品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1057_p", "source_sha256": "5d0f0bbeb862251ebb7868dce4620fd6728522d8fbae51ad1e14ea6cb43e28fd", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあの3人に、ふろくのプロデュースですか？", "zh": "什么！？\n要让她们三位负责企划附录吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1059_016tsu", "source_sha256": "02f349181a5975e079604008c0c9d8080fe6010823533f2b57f55efa87ed78a5", "ja": "{$P$}さん。お待たせ♪\n……あれ？　今話してたのって……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，久等了♪\n……咦？刚刚和你讲话的人是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "072c1bbf17f63597961f2483168d5ddc2f447a6013718e9584a47e3145724916", "ja": "ああ。\n『りるきゃん』の編集長さんだよ。", "zh": "嗯，\n是《莉露甜心》的总编。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1061_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c1b2bd974914402b17edaba4d168177d732d8aca5e525db6c150c6bbde2cf919", "ja": "やっぱり！\nサインもらえばよかった～。", "zh": "果然！\n早知道就该去要签名的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1062_p", "source_sha256": "ca75c0fc74a380653545d5b8bd0441d95e0804232591fff8a19da416074cfa25", "ja": "それなら、まだチャンスがあるかもしれないぞ。\n実はな……。", "zh": "我想往后应该还有机会喔，\n是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1068_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8877b695af4ff25278d3be428de7d1d78d4e95b4008841ec84c121211e061d42", "ja": "『りるきゃん』の……。", "zh": "《莉露甜心》的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1069_045kar", "source_sha256": "dc50edba34c7c746dcf31b8a5c4a9f36bd7e344ff8b2f50a707cd14173c637b0", "ja": "ふ、ふろくを……。", "zh": "附、附录……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1070_023aka", "source_sha256": "2ad49c6286aa3aec4ca652555c5129cdae743b0f1658ceaee5d592dbe490e102", "ja": "プロデュース！？", "zh": "要给小茜我们企划！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1071_016tsu", "source_sha256": "222665630e9b81d968bffc8eb0bc53fa91b77424ceac5d2a1856f8d01d02aa60", "ja": "やるやるっ！\nなんだか面白そう♪", "zh": "我要做我要做！\n感觉很有趣♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1072_023aka", "source_sha256": "fadab65a89b34d5280238fc91e275bd22e7c502edfb38811b4a6ae3fa0692b67", "ja": "ここでも、茜ちゃんのセンスが求められてるんだね！\n茜ちゃんのプロデュース、期待してくれていいよ♪", "zh": "看来考验小茜品味的时刻又到了！\n好好期待小茜企划的附录吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1073_045kar", "source_sha256": "02e438f78b113343a0267b8756ca617fdc53852db9076f66d98642f9495119ef", "ja": "や、やったことはないので……不安ですが……\n翼ちゃんと茜ちゃんと……一緒なら……。", "zh": "虽、虽然我没有经验……感觉不太放心……\n但如果是跟小翼与小茜……一起的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0066_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0066_story_05_1078_p", "source_sha256": "230f3f320f3682266647f0c91e3bc580899d01efc0c2946ed3bd3984066ea7d4", "ja": "（みんなの表情も生き生きとしてる。今回の仕事は、\nどんどん面白い方向に転がっていくな！）", "zh": "（她们每个都神采奕奕的，\n这次的工作发展得越来越有趣了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
